      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Cleric 4, Domains class feature</p><p>The cleric can use metamagic feats with domain spells. When using metamagic feats with domain spells, he can spend MP up to his spell level minus the spell level of the domain spell. (For example, if a 7th level cleric were to cast Fire as a 1st-level domain spell, he can spend up to 2 MP to use metamagic feats.)</p>",
